    "marketing.terms.s7.body": "Much of the catalog is provided via third-party APIs and remains subject to those providers' terms. SoundBloom does not guarantee availability of any particular track or artist. External links (social profiles, news) open at your own risk.",
    "marketing.terms.s8.title": "8. Privacy and data",
    "marketing.terms.s8.body": "We process account data (email, username, profile photo), library activity, and artist upload metadata to operate the service. Authentication is handled via Supabase; secrets must not be shared. Contact us to request account deletion.",
    "marketing.terms.s9.title": "9. Suspension and termination",
    "marketing.terms.s9.body": "We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms, abuse the platform, or pose security risks. You may stop using SoundBloom at any time. Upon termination, your right to access the service ends; some data may be retained as required by law.",
